1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,587
It's easy to sing after

2
00:00:01,587 --> 00:00:03,450
the miracle. Israel sang on

3
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:04,761
the far side of the

4
00:00:04,761 --> 00:00:07,315
sea. But what about before you cross?

5
00:00:07,315 --> 00:00:08,962
A huge army was coming

6
00:00:08,962 --> 00:00:10,535
for King Jehoshaphat.

7
00:00:10,535 --> 00:00:11,733
Yahweh told him:

8
00:00:11,733 --> 00:00:13,006
do not be afraid,

9
00:00:13,006 --> 00:00:15,852
the battle is not yours, but Yahweh's.

10
00:00:15,852 --> 00:00:18,427
So Jehoshaphat did something strange.

11
00:00:18,427 --> 00:00:19,888
He put the singers in

12
00:00:19,888 --> 00:00:21,141
front of the army:

13
00:00:21,141 --> 00:00:22,672
give thanks to Yahweh,

14
00:00:22,672 --> 00:00:25,178
