22
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:39,410
Suddenly an earthquake shook it,

23
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:40,869
and every door opened.

24
00:00:40,869 --> 00:00:42,473
Praise is not the reward

25
00:00:42,473 --> 00:00:43,543
for the victory.

26
00:00:43,543 --> 00:00:45,080
It's how we walk toward

27
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:46,550
it. Whatever sea is in

28
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:47,419
front of you,

29
00:00:47,419 --> 00:00:48,889
sing before you cross.
